      "text": "79,285.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **135** and **591**, we'll follow a step-by-step multiplication process:\n\n### Step 1: Multiply 135 by each digit of 591\n\n1. **Ones place (1):**\n   \\[\n   135 \\times 1 = 135\n   \\]\n\n2. **Tens place (9):**\n   \\[\n   135 \\times 90 = 12,\\!150\n   \\]\n\n3. **Hundreds place (5):**\n   \\[\n   135 \\times 500 = 67,\\!500\n   \\]\n\n### Step 2: Sum all the results\n\n\\[\n135 + 12,\\!150 + 67,\\!500 = 79,\\!785\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{79,\\!785}\n\\]",
